
Releases
-----------
v2.7.0
------
- Optimize AArch64 NEON 16x8 and 16x16 SAD (Commit: 6fe62b8f, PR: #4041)
- Fix signed integer overflow in CVpFrameWork::CheckValid() (Commit: bb719990, PR: #4047)
- Re-land #4002 and #4010 with a fix for the stall they caused (Commit: 1a0073f0, PR: #4019)
- Build iOS libraries in CI (Commit: 8b2d28fa, PR: #4023)
- Build Android libraries for all supported ABIs in CI (Commit: 4a7bf589, PR: #4021)
- Align Android shared libraries to 16 KB pages (Commit: 58295518, PR: #3997)
- Fix regression when encoding very large frames (Commit: 6e99da76, PR: #4016)
- Teach GMP encoder to notify on encoding failures (Commit: 868922c2, PR: #4017)
- Revert PR4002 and PR4010 (Commit: 6b35819a, PR: #4015)
- Fix bi-predicted 16x8/8x16 macroblocks in B slices (Commit: 94085e61, PR: #4004)
- Make decoder input data outlive OpenH264VideoDecoder::Decode_w() (Commit: 13595036, PR: #4009)
- Clear stale hand-off signals when the new-sequence chain is cut (Commit: 4a0b5547, PR: #4010)
- Bound AVCC SPS/PPS walk against codec-specific data size (Commit: 303b005f, PR: #3991)
- Guard threaded DPB reallocation (Commit: 0bab7fe8, PR: #4002)
- Guard ResetCurrentAccessUnit against AU list counter overflow (Commit: 9d974972, PR: #4000)
- Revert the threaded post-return writes fix for caller ppDst (Commit: a72a8466, PR: #4003)
- Avoid threaded post-return writes to caller ppDst (Commit: 5bfbf01c, PR: #4001)
- Re-sync threaded reference snapshot after MMCO5 reset (Commit: cd7a487e, PR: #3999)
- Serialize buffered-picture queue under the decoder lock (Commit: b4cffc30, PR: #3998)
- Zero-initialize CWelsDecoder reordering state in the constructor (Commit: 80760028, PR: #3996)
- Restrict IncreasePicBuff ownership reset to new slots only (Commit: 873ecbe6, PR: #3995)
- Snapshot per-thread previous decoded picture before the finish signal (Commit: 960414d6, PR: #3994)
- Guard sRawData wrap against queued slice overwrite (Commit: 562ffca1, PR: #3993)
- Retarget parse-only pNalPos after saved-buffer growth (Commit: 2b2f9610, PR: #3992)
- Use memset instead of MMX for fixed-size buffer zeroing (Commit: 728ec6a6, PR: #3987)
- Validate error-concealment copy source and destination compatibility (Commit: 3137f7f1, PR: #3990)
- Fix final load-balancing argument parsing (Commit: 24d74dbf, PR: #3974)
- Validate GMP BufferLength32 lengths before rewrite (Commit: d7ec45ab, PR: #3971)
- Harden bitstream tail reads against out-of-bounds access (Commit: 1bc7c224, PR: #3989)
- Prevent signed integer overflow in rate-control target bit allocation (Commit: 9547f96e, PR: #3982)
- Fix decoder sanitizer findings in unit tests and timeout math (Commit: 5c41f379, PR: #3986)
- Fix ExpandBsBuffer queued retarget use-after-free (Commit: 772e63d3, PR: #3985)
- Re-derive stale thread picture before reference write (Commit: 4cbd8a1c, PR: #3984)
- Prevent threaded decoder deadlock on lost references (Commit: 3738dd5c, PR: #3983)
- Validate chroma strides before downsampling (Commit: 8ed65601, PR: #3977)
- Guard GetColocatedMb against a null colocated picture before waiting (Commit: 98bc7cbb, PR: #3978)
- Validate encoder geometry area using widened arithmetic (Commit: 24ff6e94, PR: #3976)
- Add coverage for the per-frame PSNR API (Commit: 35325f40, PR: #3975)
- Bounds-check CAVLC I_PCM copy before reading the bitstream (Commit: 4a2615fa, PR: #3968)
- Validate FMO slice-group run length before building the allocation map (Commit: d59cefb5, PR: #3967)
- Fix slice buffer size validation and allocation during dynamic load balancing (Commit: fca40fc1, PR: #3966)
- Fix asymmetric chroma plane stride handling in encoder preprocessing (Commit: e22b2731, PR: #3961)
- Initialize iPicBuffIdx and validate it before picture buffer indexing (Commit: 5afa9190, PR: #3965)
- Fix thread cleanup and memory leaks during partial initialization (Commit: 1189afa8, PR: #3959)
- Clamp screen-content scroll motion vectors to the configured range (Commit: 1253268a, PR: #3962)
- Revert dynamic slice adjustment for frames with extreme aspect ratios (Commit: 95eb9b05, PR: #3964)
- Fix dynamic slice adjustment for frames with extreme aspect ratios (Commit: d91f567b, PR: #3960)
- Fix SumOfFrame for extremely wide frames (Commit: 6d95111e, PR: #3958)
- Prevent potential undefined behavior in WelsCommon::BsFlush() (Commit: 40555ec6, PR: #3957)
- Upgrade bundled gtest to 1.15.2 (Commit: 3bc90ba5, PR: #3963)
- Allocate enough space for all slices (Commit: a8e04adb, PR: #3956)
- Harden parse-only VCL NAL save logic in au_parser (Commit: e3f5b104, PR: #3944)
- Guard AArch64 assembly with __aarch64__ (Commit: cf568c83, PR: #3905)
- Fix crashes on 2k3000 (Commit: 1c5ac2f8, PR: #3897)
- Update Windows/MinGW CI (Commit: a0175163, PR: #3906)
- Add FreeBSD to common POSIX platforms in meson.build (Commit: 0c9a557a, PR: #3867)
- Fix issue #3837 (Commit: c2e7c4a3, PR: #3868)
- Remove unused parameters in VAACalcSad_lsx (Commit: f2853499, PR: #3864)
- Update shared library version for Meson (Commit: a85e1187, PR: #3860)

